@format 1
@id queue.add-work
@title Add work to schedule
@area Queue
@entry input
@summary Persist built work records as pending items, assign routing and lineage, and notify schedule observers.
@flow TB
@related queue.claim-work
@tag queue
@tag persistence

@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule
@alias store = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScheduleStore

[input] Built work items arrive <input>
- Receive work items with optional relay source and target identifiers @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
> prepare

[prepare] Prepare each record <process>
- Apply relay routing to the item @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
- Resolve lineage when it has not already been assigned @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
- Convert the work item to its persistent record @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
> save

[save] Persist pending work <decision>
- Save the record in the scheduled depot folder @ store.LScheduleRecordSave(...)
? "Record save succeeds" > collect
? "Record save fails" > skipped

[collect] Publish pending item <process>
- Add the item to the observable in-memory schedule @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
> result

[skipped] Skip unsaved item <error>
- Record that the item could not be filed @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
= The unsaved item is absent from the schedule.

[result] Schedule changed <output>
- Notify schedule observers when at least one item was added @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
= Every successfully saved item is visible and claimable as pending work.
